OL,3,ADonald Trump says he is banning CNN and
OL,4,APolitico from White House
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has announced
OL,7,Fthat he is "immediately" banning CNN,
OL,8,FMS NOW and Politico from the White
OL,9,FHouse, the latest twist in his fraught
OL,10,Frelationship with American media
OL,11,Foutlets.
OL,13,FIn a lengthy post on Truth Social on
OL,14,FFriday, Trump said that the outlets
OL,15,F"constantly write or report fiction or
OL,16,Flies" about his administration,
OL,17,Falthough he provided no examples.
OL,19,FIt is unclear what exactly a ban would
OL,20,Fentail, and whether employees of those
OL,21,Foutlets would be prevented from
OL,22,Fentering the White House grounds.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
